
This archive contains sources for CSR's XAP2+ ports of GCC and Binutils. 


== Contents of this Archive ==

README             - This file
gcc-xap.diff       - Diff relative to GCC 4.3.4
gcc-extra.tgz      - Files added to GCC
binutils-xap.diff  - Diff relative to Binutils 2.17
binutils-extra.tgz - Files added to Binutils
build.sh           - Build script


== Building the Software ==

- On Microsoft Windows, download and install MSys and MinGW from
  http://www.mingw.org

- Download the following files to the csr-xap-gcc-src-434 directory

http://www.mirrorservice.org/sites/ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gcc/gcc-4.3.4/gcc-core-4.3.4.tar.gz
http://www.mirrorservice.org/sites/ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gmp/gmp-4.3.1.tar.gz
http://www.mirrorservice.org/sites/ftp.gnu.org/gnu/mpfr/mpfr-2.4.2.tar.gz
http://www.mirrorservice.org/sites/ftp.gnu.org/gnu/binutils/binutils-2.17.tar.bz2

The MD5 digests should be as follows:

1d81edd0569de4d84091526fd578dd7b  binutils-2.17.tar.bz2
9a135473a12978a22b7ca2fc51485762  gcc-core-4.3.4.tar.gz
a8f60ac823a16e61335dba9c08875c06  gmp-4.3.1.tar.gz
0e3dcf9fe2b6656ed417c89aa9159428  mpfr-2.4.2.tar.gz

- In the shell (MSys on windows), change to the csr-xap-gcc-src-434 directory
  and run ./build.sh

- GCC will install to ./install/gcc/, binutils to ./install/binutils/.

